    "description": "Configured and operated JNN, CPN, BCN, HCLOS, and STT communication equipment.\nConfigured and installed Cisco routers, Cisco switches, and Cisco Unified Communications Manager. \nRan cables from existing patch panels to new patch panels.\nSecured router and switches in the proper locations for peak performance.\nMaintained company routers, switches, computers, printers, cables, and other equipment.\nConfigured and maintained KIV-7M, KG 175D TACLAN, and CTM-100.\nConsistently monitored network and bandwidth usage with Solarwinds and other network monitoring software.\nPerformed ongoing maintenance and testing of networks and network related equipment\nForwarded trouble tickets to the proper level support.\nLogged trouble tickets/calls from the customer in ticket tracking software/logs.\nPerform basic testing of workstations and communication equipment.\nProvided helpdesk support and resolved problems to the end user’s satisfaction\nInstallation and repair of WAN/LAN related equipment.\nSupervised and trained subordinates on equipment use and day to day task.\nConducted monthly written performance evaluations of 6 subordinates.",
